# INVWINRP.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: pick lists longer
# than their window.  Twelve locations added inside the tree's first
# row, the tree counting fifteen; F4 in the item form's Location then
# opens the location pick list on item 1's location, its window full,
# twelve rows, at its start, its end and a page down.  Ten copies of
# item 1 make thirteen items; Install in and F4 in its empty field
# list every item, again twelve rows to a window.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRP.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B
S TREE
K HOME INS
T Bin 01
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 02
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 03
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 04
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 05
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 06
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 07
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 08
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 09
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 10
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 11
K ENTER HOME INS
T Bin 12
K ENTER
S ADDED
K HOME
S TREECNT
# item 1's form in edit mode, the location pick list
K ESC ENTER CTRL-E ALT-L F4
S LOCPICK
K HOME
S LOCHOME
K PGDN
S LOCPGDN
K END
S LOCEND
K ESC ESC
S LIST
# ten copies of item 1, each saved with its quantity changed
K HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER HOME
S ITEMS
# Install in: F4 in the empty field lists every item
K ALT-C I F4
S ITEMPICK
K END
S ITEMEND
K ESC ESC
K ALT-F X
